WEBVTT

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:06.537
A number can ring one person instead of a queue.

00:00:06.537 --> 00:00:10.601
Add another call entry point, and name it Sales direct line.

00:00:12.959 --> 00:00:14.282
Pick its number.

00:00:14.282 --> 00:00:18.432
Then set Route to to Specific agent, and pick the Target agent.

00:00:18.432 --> 00:00:21.019
The call never falls back to a queue.

00:00:25.571 --> 00:00:29.729
Ring window sets how many seconds the agent's phone rings.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:35.317
Send unanswered calls to voicemail, which is ticked, takes a message afterwards.

00:00:35.317 --> 00:00:36.421
Click Save.

